ives\n\n$$\n12x+12=A(x-1)(x+5)+B(x-3)(x+5)+C(x-3)(x-1).\n$$\n\nFor $x=3$, we get \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}12(3)+12 & =A(3-1)(3+5) \\\\  & \\,+B(3-3)(3+5) \\\\  & \\,+C(3-3)(3-1) \\\\ 36+12 & =A(2)(8) \\\\ A & =\\frac{48}{16} \\\\ A & =3.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFor $x=1$, we get \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}12(1)+12 & =A(1-1)(1+5) \\\\  & \\,+B(1-3)(1+5) \\\\  & \\,+C(1-3)(1-1) \\\\ 12+12 & =B(-2)(6) \\\\ B & =\\frac{24}{-12} \\\\ B & =-2.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFor $x=-5$, we get \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}12(-5)+12 & =A(-5-1)(-5+5) \\\\  & \\,+B(-5-3)(-5+5) \\\\  & \\,+C(-5-3)(-5-1) \\\\ -60+12 & =C(-8)(-6) \\\\ C & =\\frac{-48}{48} \\\\ C & =-1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHence,\n\n$$\n\\frac{12x+12}{(x-3)(x-1)(x+5)}=\\frac{3}{(x-3)}-\\frac{2}{(x-1)}-\\frac{1}{(x+5)}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-69751/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "7e66d7cf-1a4b-51e6-9c78-f70a8c0555df"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-69751"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-351008/field-1/62a6fd1cf465955cead36d661dcbed2f93206049c15d21d7eebcabb802d1aa54" :answer/id #uuid "22798587-b17d-5e2f-b6c6-cbf355611f3a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-351008/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "bdb2af3c-b1ec-5cf2-a877-2ecbdf7ea581" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-351008/field-1/62a6fd1cf465955cead36d661dcbed2f93206049c15d21d7eebcabb802d1aa54" :answer-field/choices ["q-351008/field-1/62a6fd1cf465955cead36d661dcbed2f93206049c15d21d7eebcabb802d1aa54"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-351008/field-2/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" :answer/id #uuid "2961c9d0-4bc5-584e-bf4a-658a7c96a344" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-351008/field-2" :answer-field/id #uuid "b6d22f4c-28d3-5d0f-b824-6426ba